    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 6,
        "sourceEnd": 337,
        "text": "Okay, everyone, thanks for coming. This is the first meeting of the Riverside Community Garden group. We have twelve people here tonight. Let me start with the problem. Last summer, the empty lot on Mill Street was full of rubbish. People dumped old chairs and broken TVs there. It smelled bad, and children could not play outside.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "842a1a1a0ed74db29d7be005a08ac066fa95a3e065bc13ed4d2747a096656105",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "daniel",
        "speaker": "Daniel",
        "sourceStart": 347,
        "sourceEnd": 529,
        "text": "Sorry, can I say something? I live on Mill Street. The rubbish was bad, yes, but the bigger problem was the rats. We saw rats every evening. My neighbour called the city three times.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "1ff8ed3a3d43bee200eb144eb7c1dcb05058df073e0bd80037a1fdc8d592200e",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 537,
        "sourceEnd": 815,
        "text": "Right, thank you, Daniel. So the shared problem is rubbish and rats. Now, what can we do locally? I have three ideas. First, we ask the city for two large bins. Second, we start a garden club and grow vegetables. Third, we put up a sign that says “Please keep this place clean.”",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "13f0315a169d422d49e08e8d2b7975ffcaace854f5849dfa4c070283a6453ea3",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "priya",
        "speaker": "Priya",
        "sourceStart": 824,
        "sourceEnd": 939,
        "text": "I like the garden idea, but I have a question. Who will water the plants in summer? Most of us work during the day.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "2b8973ba97d686740f6185e20949db37bd6b3d781178f5c41c043770056798fd",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 947,
        "sourceEnd": 1087,
        "text": "Good point. We could make a watering rota. Each person waters once a week. If we have twelve members, that is only twelve weeks of watering.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "52cd4de1e24e2b37857942a56a4684923c786f26fcd32e6e2d61d7ee63667c48",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "daniel",
        "speaker": "Daniel",
        "sourceStart": 1097,
        "sourceEnd": 1248,
        "text": "Wait, twelve members and one week each — that is twelve weeks, but summer is only about ten weeks. So we need two more weeks. Maybe families can share.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "818ccfcf9221834739408eb1820231c77e5a223297d69a416f2c8c2dfe311fab",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 1256,
        "sourceEnd": 1359,
        "text": "You are right. Let me correct that. We need a rota of about ten weeks, and some people can water twice.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "598865b7d65f2af469d32ce3740042a96877eb68b2a50d370838b23d0831a946",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "priya",
        "speaker": "Priya",
        "sourceStart": 1368,
        "sourceEnd": 1513,
        "text": "Also, the city bins are not free. I checked online. Two large bins cost 80 dollars each year. That is 160 dollars. We do not have that money now.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "ea0a2f7ca275aac1e8e29186f0da4e9cd116a7f63c6042f578161a8aa6c98494",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "daniel",
        "speaker": "Daniel",
        "sourceStart": 1523,
        "sourceEnd": 1664,
        "text": "But we could raise money. Last year the school raised 300 dollars with a cake sale. If we sell cakes and old books, we might get 200 dollars.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "6463aa52c580d3e62e25b17a6336d87d0041b329f50e7ce168d087e78aeb8941",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 1672,
        "sourceEnd": 1797,
        "text": "That is a good estimate. So, condition: if we raise 200 dollars, we can pay for the bins and still have 40 dollars for seeds.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "ad1912a20b9442e36fac851820e6fccf0079b575236508143a077c26bd5b4107",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "priya",
        "speaker": "Priya",
        "sourceStart": 1806,
        "sourceEnd": 1917,
        "text": "Although the cake sale is a good idea, it takes a lot of time. I work on Saturdays. Could we do it on a Sunday?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "70f9949577ee7d98f705da3343dfeba0277a0bb3983bdf3627e077a5b0711cb4",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 1925,
        "sourceEnd": 2060,
        "text": "Yes, Sunday is better. Let us agree: the cake sale is on Sunday, the 14th of next month. Daniel, can you ask the school for the tables?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "046760ef6ad0cc9c6deca12d6546d56809b30f955d14102f7d4608d0701bf8e0",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "daniel",
        "speaker": "Daniel",
        "sourceStart": 2070,
        "sourceEnd": 2180,
        "text": "Sure. I will ask them tomorrow. But I should say — I am not sure the school will say yes. They are often busy.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "08c01eda448713a14573e804161f7aa87e775c62c04455c25706bafec4f7c99a",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 2188,
        "sourceEnd": 2271,
        "text": "That is fine. Even if they say no, we can use my garage. It is small, but it works.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "6fb6cf0444683b1afaac431380db46fee6b299c207e2ed557e8a072732a307a8",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "priya",
        "speaker": "Priya",
        "sourceStart": 2280,
        "sourceEnd": 2379,
        "text": "One more thing. The sign. Who will make it? I can paint, but I am not very good at writing English.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "2e5a8d5c8556645b39a382602bb0963628b7b692ff95fc4e6406cbb765fc1638",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 2387,
        "sourceEnd": 2597,
        "text": "I can write the words, and you can paint the letters. That is a good team. So, to summarise: we ask the city for bins, we plan a Sunday cake sale, we make a watering rota, and we put up a sign. Any other ideas?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "9581f40aa8f0e10031989304c404ca485b31775f8ca900a5a60e23b510b3c6da",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "daniel",
        "speaker": "Daniel",
        "sourceStart": 2607,
        "sourceEnd": 2717,
        "text": "What about the rats? Bins help, but we also need to cut the long grass near the wall. Rats hide in tall grass.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "e7d92d5c3c6d8fa2c6794b3cb017b09174ad1c75160ac3c12a8a2055bcebbb91",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 2725,
        "sourceEnd": 2867,
        "text": "Excellent point. So we add one more job: cut the grass. We can do that next Saturday morning. I will bring tools. Priya, can you bring gloves?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "44211ecce9ca2a2523ac470ca6f62f78fd80c7d5f4ab416fa9a9e0d6b9831880",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "priya",
        "speaker": "Priya",
        "sourceStart": 2876,
        "sourceEnd": 2918,
        "text": "Yes, I have four pairs. I will bring them.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "f487bec3e5ce05cd2c0b47669e9807e7a546c3defe8f2f971f9276cceb1eab25",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 2926,
        "sourceEnd": 3025,
        "text": "Great. So our next meeting is in two weeks. Thank you, everyone. This was a very useful discussion.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "268c9535490125787929a63b506f78f275a4ff015715f7a432b76b97c3af2191",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      }
    ]
  },
